{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"<@264570136025890816> Good night! You'll get a ping when your 8 hours pass.","created_at":"2021-08-25T05:43:42.471000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879964234589569024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"After hours upon hours of work collecting bodies, now came the burying of said bodies. Like before, she prepared the bodies for burial, dug the graves, did the ceremony if she knew which one to perform, and buried the body. This continues for several hours until she finally takes a break to sketch out her dream home.","created_at":"2021-08-25T07:20:52.104000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879988685842558986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Secel eventually stopped and slammed the shovel into the dirt. Taking a few deep breaths , the woman moves over to where the home she wants will be. She than sat down and began planning it out in her head. 20 feet by 8 feet, 150 square feet, bottom floor having the kitchen and dining room, the bathroom, and the living room. Top floor would hold the bedroom. \n\nShe then began piecing it out in her mind. The entrance would be spaced between the kitchen and living room, with the bathroom at connected on the opposite side of the living room. The bedroom would be a short flight of stairs up, and a small place for the two of them. Then outside would be the cooking place with brick surrounding it to protect from fires. \n\nSmiling to herself, and wanting desperately to have Jean-Paul ask her to marry her, she let herself dream until she falls asleep.","created_at":"2021-08-25T08:52:59.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880011868897415198","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
